9", "publish_date": "2014", "publishers": ["Van hoc"], "source_records": ["bwb:9786046935889"], "subjects": ["Wiggin, ender (fictitious character), fiction", "Battle school (imaginary place), fiction", "Fiction, science fiction, hard science fiction", "Siblings, fiction"], "title": "Ender's Game", "full_title": "Ender's Game", "works": [{"key": "/works/OL49488W"}], "key": "/books/OL48221993M", "latest_revision": 3, "revision": 3, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2023-06-17T09:43:34.496930"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2023-10-25T07:50:32.106851"}}, {"type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "authors": [{"key": "/authors/OL25161A"}], "isbn_13": ["9780606040433"], "languages": [{"key": "/languages/eng"}], "publish_date": "1985", "publishers": ["Turtleback"], "source_records": ["bwb:9780606040433"], "subjects": ["Wiggin, ender (fictitious character), fiction", "Fiction, science fiction, hard science fiction", "Battle school (imaginary place), fiction", "Siblings, fiction"], "title": "Ender's Game", "full_title": "Ender's Game", "works": [{"key": "/works/OL49488W"}], "key": "/books/OL48223729M", "latest_revision": 3, "revision": 3, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2023-06-17T09:49:41.714041"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2023-10-25T07:50:32.106851"}}, {"publishers": ["Tor"], "classifications": {}, "title": "Ender's game", "identifiers": {}, "covers": [14524790], "publish_date": "2013", "key": "/books/OL28230774M", "works": [{"key": "/works/OL49488W"}], "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "physical_format": "paperback", "copyright_date": "2013", "edition_name": "Second Tor teen edition; movie tie-in", "number_of_pages": 380, "pagination": "380p.", "languages": [{"key": "/languages/eng"}], "publish_places": ["New York"], "isbn_10": ["0765337320"], "isbn_13": ["9780765337320"], "ocaid": "endersgame0000card_u3u4", "latest_revision": 37, "revision": 37, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2020-06-10T13:31:03.002173"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2023-10-25T07:50:32.106851"}}, {"publishers": ["B de Books"], "translated_from": [{"key": "/languages/eng"}], "description": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "La Tierra se ve amenazada por una raza extraterrestre, los insectores, que se comunican telep\u00e1ticamente y consideran no tener nada en com\u00fan con los humanos, a quienes pretenden destruir.\r\n\r\nPara vencerlos es necesario una nueva clase de genio militar, y por ello se ha permitido el nacimiento de Ender, lo que constituye, en cierta forma, una anomal\u00eda, pues es el tercer hijo de una pareja en un mundo que ha limitado estrictamente a dos el n\u00famero de descendientes.\r\n\r\nEl ni\u00f1o Ender deber\u00e1 aprender todo lo relativo a la guerra en los videojuegos y en los peligrosos ensayos de batallas espaciales que realiza con sus compa\u00f1eros. A la habilidad en el tratamiento de las emociones, ya caracter\u00edstica de Orson Scott Card, se une en este libro el inter\u00e9s por el empleo de las simulaciones por ordenador y los juegos de fantas\u00eda en la formaci\u00f3n militar, estrat\u00e9gica y psicol\u00f3gica del protagonista.\r\n\r\nSource: https://www.megustaleer.com/libros/el-juego-de-ender-saga-de-ender-1/MES-095781"}, "contributors": [{"role": "Translator", "name": "Antonio S\u00e1nchez"}, {"role": "Translator", "name": "Jos\u00e9 Mar\u00eda Rodelgo"}], "series": ["Saga de Ender 1"], "covers": [8186459], "physical_format": "Epub", "key": "/books/OL26457867M", "publish_places": ["Barcelona, Spain"], "edition_name": "1st Edici\u00f3n 30 aniversario", "languages": [{"key": "/languages/spa"}], "title": "El juego de Ender", "translation_of": "Ender's Game", "identifiers": {"amazon": ["B06W2PMY1T"], "goodreads": ["40488273", "34682690"]}, "isbn_13": ["9788490696682"], "publish_date": "2017 March", "copyright_date": "1987", "works": [{"key": "/works/OL49488W"}], "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "latest_revision": 6, "revision": 6, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2018-06-07T15:00:59.848456"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2023-10-25T07:50:32.106851"}}, {"publishers": ["Tor"], "table_of_contents": [{"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "Third --", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "Peter --", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "Graff --", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "Launch --", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "Games --", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "The giant's drink --", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "Salamander --", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "Rat --", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "Locke and Demosthenes --", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "Dragon --", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "Veni vidi vici --", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "Bonzo --", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "Valentine --", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "Ender's teacher --", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "Speaker for the dead.", "pagenum": ""}], "description": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "Once again, the Earth is under attack. An alien species is poised for a final assault. The survival of humanity depends on a military genius who can defeat the aliens. But who?\r\n\r\nEnder Wiggin. Brilliant. Ruthless. Cunning. A tactical and strategic master. And a child.\r\n\r\nRecruited for military training by the world government, Ender's childhood ends the moment he enters his new home: Battle School. Among the elite recruits Ender proves himself to be a genius among geniuses. He excels in simulated war games. But is the pressure and loneliness taking its toll on Ender? Simulations are one thing. How will Ender perform in real combat conditions? After all, Battle School is just a game.\r\n\r\nIsn't it?\r\n(back cover)"}, "covers": [8186413], "key": "/books/OL26457803M", "edition_name": "Movie Tie-in Edition", "languages": [{"key": "/languages/eng"}], "title": "Ender's Game", "identifiers": {"alibris_id": ["9780765337542"], "google": ["ilnCkgEACAAJ"], "amazon.ca_asin": ["0765337541"], "paperback_swap": ["0765337541"], "amazon": ["0765337541"], "goodreads": ["17167088"]}, "isbn_13": ["9780765337542"], "isbn_10": ["0765337541"], "publish_date": "2013", "copyright_date": "2013", "oclc_numbers": ["841033969"], "works": [{"key": "/works/OL49488W"}], "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "latest_revision": 5, "revision": 5, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2018-06-07T08:23:56.449450"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2023-10-25T07:50:32.106851"}}, {"publishers": ["Audio Literature", "Brand: Audio Literature"], "series": ["Ender (1)"], "physical_format": "Audio cassette", "key": "/books/OL8144895M", "subjects": ["Science Fiction - General", "Audio - Science Fiction / Fantasy"], "languages": [{"key": "/languages/eng"}], "title": "Ender's Game", "notes": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "Audio"}, "identifiers": {"amazon": ["0787122440"], "goodreads": ["2860938"], "librarything": ["825739"]}, "isbn_13": ["9780787122447"], "isbn_10": ["0787122440"], "publish_date": "1999 November", "oclc_numbers": ["43765504"], "works": [{"key": "/works/OL49488W"}], "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "physical_dimensions": "7 x 4.8 x 0.7 inches", "covers": [13827756], "source_records": ["amazon:0787122440"], "latest_revision": 12, "revision": 12, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2008-04-29T15:03:11.581851"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2023-10-25T07:50:32.106851"}}, {"publishers": ["Orbit"], "table_of_contents": [{"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "By Orson Scott Card", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "Copyright", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "Introduction", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "THIRD", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "PETER", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "GRAFF", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "LAUNCH", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "GAMES", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "THE GIANTS DRINK", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "SALAMANDER", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "LOCKE AND DEMOSTHENES", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "DRAGON", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "VENIVIDIVICI", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "BONZO", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "VALENTINE", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "ENDERS TEACHER", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "SPEAKER FOR THE DEAD", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "Acknowledgments", "pagenum": ""}, {"level": 0, "label": "", "title": "Copyright", "pagenum": ""}], "description": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "The worldwide bestselling and award-winning classic science fiction novel - also a major motion picture\r\nThe human race faces annihilation.\r\n\r\nAn alien threat is on the horizon, ready to strike. And if humanity is to be defended, the government must create the greatest military commander in history.\r\n\r\nThe brilliant young Ender Wiggin is their last hope. But first he must survive the rigours of a brutal military training program - to prove that he can be the leader of all leaders.\r\n\r\nA saviour for mankind must be produced, through whatever means possible. But are they creating a hero or a monster?\r\n\r\nThis is the multiple award-winning classic ENDER'S GAME - a groundbreaking tale of war, strategy and survival.\r\n\r\nSource: https://www.hachette.co.uk/books/detail.page?isbn=9780748134205"}, "covers": [8186171], "physical_format": "Epub", "key": "/books/OL26457569M", "pu